  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Galileo Invest - Feasibility study - Tilapia genetics and hatchery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The business idea is to own and operate tilapia; (i) hatchery and (ii) breeding nucleus for a family selection program of about 120 families. In the short term, or the &#x201c;main project&#x201d;, will be focused on investment in (i) hatchery. A later investment in a (ii) breeding nucleus for family selection will add another NOK 12 million in investments and 1,7 million in annual operating costs.</narrative>
  </description>
